      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Module 1 – Stock and flow\nIndicator \nNumber\nIndicator  \nabbreviated name\nIndicator full name\nNumerator\nDenominator\nDisaggregation\n1-01\nHealth worker* \ndensity\nDensity of health workers per  \n10 000 population\nNumber of active health workers, \ndefined in headcounts\nTotal population**\nBy occupation, by occupation  \nand activity level\n1-02\nHealth worker density \nat subnational level\nDensity of active health workers per \n10 000 population at subnational level\nNumber of active health workers in \nlevel 1 subnational administrative \nunits\nTotal population at subnational \nlevel\nBy occupation\n1-03\nHeal",
