      "content": "Indicator name\nAverage entry-level wage and salary excluding social contributions\nDisaggregation\nBy occupation, by occupation and public/private\nDefinition\nAverage wage or salary in US$ received by health workers when entering the active health  \nlabour market, excluding social contributions.\nDisaggregation by public vs private source is suggested, although often only the source from  \nthe public sector is available.\nGlossary\n•\t \tActive health worker\n•\t \tOccupation\n•\t \tRemuneration\n•\t \tWage and salary\nData reporting frequency \nand reporting frameworks\nAnnual\nReporting frameworks: Global Strate",
