      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Working conditions, governance \nand leadership \nModule summary\nThis module addresses working conditions, governance and leadership from various perspectives: \nhealth workers, national leadership capacity, and contribution of the country to regional and \nglobal mandates. The first indicator, from the workers’ perspective, aims at identifying how \nwell regulations and policy protect them. The second and third indicators are from the national \nleadership perspective. They seek to identify the extent to which mechanisms and tools exist \nat national level to coordinate the HRH agenda, including pro",
