      "target": "../sections/sec-053-4-05-national-capacity-to-monitor-key-metrics-fo.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "workforce planning and global monitoring frameworks\nNational health workforce accounts: a handbook – second edition\n76\nGlossary\n•\t \tInternational Health Regulations\n•\t \tSubnational level\n•\t \tActive health worker\n•\t \tOccupation\n•\t \tRemuneration\n•\t \tStatus in employment\n•\t \tGender\nData reporting frequency \nand reporting frameworks\nAnnual\nReporting framework: Global Strategy for Human Resources for Health: Workforce 2030 (GSHRH), \nWorking for Health programme, Global Strategic Directions for Nursing and Midwifery (SDNM),  \nSCORE for Health Data Technical Package (SCORE)\nPotential data sources\n•",
