        "text": "Closing part of the metadata sheet for indicator 4-05, national capacity to monitor key metrics for health workforce planning and global monitoring frameworks: its glossary terms, annual reporting for the Global Strategy, Working for Health, SDNM and SCORE, and potential data sources — national and subnational ministries of health, professional chambers, workforce policy and monitoring units, the Ministry of Labour, the national statistical office, the national focal point for the WHO Global Code of Practice and other institutions collecting workforce data.",
